{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 267, "line_no": 11, "text": "五、布依族岁时节日习俗聚会场所", "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 837, "w": 591, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "五、布依族岁时节日习俗聚会场所", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 837, "w": 591, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 267, "line_no": 12, "text": "布依族的岁时节日活动丰富多彩，节日聚会的场所也不胜枚举，主要有董朗桥、槟榔", "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 893, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族的岁时节日活动丰富多彩，节日聚会的场所也不胜枚举，主要有董朗桥、槟榔", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 893, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
